# Play test of Turtlewatch Atoll (CIPlay turtlewatch_atoll, in a test world 'CI ...'). No quest: the walk round the
# sanctuary, its notes and boxes, its animals. Points as in its recipe: the landing at 3 36; the pens on the east beach at
# 32 8 and 32 -6 (their open west sides); the hut on the south shore (deck 6.1 m, its ladder at 0.25 -32.1); the lookout
# at -32 4
island Turtlewatch Atoll
expect animals Turtle 4
expect animals Dolphin 2
expect animals Stingray 2
wait 5

# The north landing: the welcome board, the box
walk 3 33 to 3 35.5 h=3.2
read Welcome board
open Landing box
# Round the east side to the nesting beach: the pens' signs, the egg count, the hatchery box
walk 34 1 to 30.5 1 h=3.3
read North pen
read South pen
read Egg count board
open Hatchery box
# The warden's hut on the south shore: up its ladder; his log, the supply crate; the medicine box below
walk 4 -36 to 0.25 -34 h=3.5
climb 0.25 -32.1 h=3.5
expect stand 0.25 -30 h=6.1 below=8
read Warden's log
open Volunteers' supply crate
open Warden's medicine box
# The lookout over the west reef
walk -30 -2 to -30.5 1 h=3.4
read Reef notes
